&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;**English Translation**&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;**Must be local to Montreal**&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want to work in technology at an investment bank?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone to be a part of a dynamic team as a Golang Developer for one of our clients. This role is ideal for a backend engineer who enjoys working across both software development and operational functions. You will play a key role in developing scalable backend services, building and maintaining APIs, and supporting cloud-native infrastructure initiatives.&amp;nbsp;As part of a critical platform resilience initiative, you will contribute to the reliability and scalability of core backend systems while helping drive automation and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About mthree:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since 2010, mthree has been helping clients solve their business and technological challenges. We are a technology and business consultancy with a global workforce delivering significant business and IT projects in some of the largest financial services organizations worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Core Services:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting and Advisory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managed Services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alumni Graduate Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alumni Pro Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a global presence and are experts in delivering exceptional quality to our client base, providing consulting services across Risk, Regulation &amp;amp; Compliance; Vendor Products; Application Support; Application Development; Cyber &amp;amp; Information Security; Data Science and DevOps areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Expert program offers experienced professionals access to top roles in tech, finance, aviation and insurance. Join us to work on groundbreaking technology projects, from international trading platforms to critical applications for leading airlines. We recruit professionals who are eager to fast-track their careers in technology or operations within prestigious global organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design, develop, and maintain backend services using &lt;strong&gt;Golang&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build, enhance, and support&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;RESTful APIs&lt;/strong&gt; for platform and internal services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional engineering teams to deliver scalable and reliable solutions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Deploy, manage, and troubleshoot applications running in &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt; environments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support operational activities, including monitoring, troubleshooting, and incident resolution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Automate operational processes to improve efficiency and system reliability.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Contribute to platform stability, performance, and resilience initiatives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Participate in code reviews and follow software development best practices.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Skills Required:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of professional software development experience (approximately 5 years preferred; strong candidates with 3-4 years will be considered).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience developing applications in &lt;strong&gt;Golang&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and building &lt;strong&gt;REST APIs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt; and containerized applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with &lt;strong&gt;public cloud technologies&lt;/strong&gt; such as AWS, Azure, or GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of backend systems, distributed applications, and microservices architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting production environments and operational processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in platform engineering or infrastructure-focused teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of automation, CI/CD pipelines, and DevOps practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to reliability engineering principles and cloud-native technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with monitoring and observability tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
