&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;test-id__field-value slds-form-element__static slds-grow word-break-ie11&quot;&gt;Major Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
