&lt;p data-start=&quot;94&quot; data-end=&quot;513&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;94&quot; data-end=&quot;164&quot;&gt;Role Overview – Market Data Site Reliability and Engineering (SRE)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
