&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;608&quot; data-end=&quot;688&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;610&quot; data-end=&quot;688&quot;&gt;Monitor capacity, manage latency, and ensure platform stability and security&lt;/p&gt;
