&lt;li&gt;How to write a basic computer program in Python, including user input, common data structures, and flow of control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to use MySQL to perform CRUD (create, read, update and delete) operations on a relational database stored in a MySQL Server.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
