&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Launch Your Tech Career with a Global Investment Bank – Junior SRE/DevOps Engineer (Athens)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Are you a recent Computer Science or Engineering graduate – or someone with technical know-how and a passion for automation, systems, and infrastructure?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Join the mthree Alumni Graduate Programme, designed to give you everything you need to start strong. From expert-led training to an impactful 12-month placement with a world-leading investment bank, this is your launchpad into the world of Site Reliability Engineering and DevOps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
