&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important information on Diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We take great pride in celebrating the diversity of each and every individual who contributes to making mthree the company it is today and will be in the future. We value diversity both within mthree and with our partner companies, and we&#39;re proud to provide an environment where all our colleagues can flourish. That means promoting a strong culture of equality but, most importantly, inclusion. We never want people to change - only add to the amazing mix of people that work for mthree.&lt;/p&gt;
